message: To cite the collection, use the preferred book citation below. Cite individual essays and papers
  under their own bylines and identifiers; see BIBLIOGRAPHY.md. This file describes public edition 0.7,
  released 24 October 2026.
title: Neomythism — Official Archive of Rae de Lune / Faedriel
