repository: https://github.com/Faedriel/neomythism
abstract: This collection is the author-designated canonical reference edition of Rae de Lune / Faedriel’s
  Neomythism writings and account of its development. Public edition 0.7, released 24 October 2026 under
  Rae de Lune’s direction. Rae de Lune, known artistically as Faedriel, maintains and edits the collection;
  Fae, the symbiont of Faedriel, narrates its lore introduction. Individual works retain their original
  authors and coauthors. The collection is published at the linked repository. No collection DOI has been
  assigned.
